---
description: >-
  Label syntax (#1368): the title written as plain markdown, and each section, period and event
  written as plain markdown, a quoted markdown string, bare backticks, a code span, tags and a
  written \n. Only the markdown strings are bold and italic; the plain markdown, the bare
  backticks and the code span are drawn as written.
---
timeline
  title title **bold** _ital_
  section section **bold** _ital_
    period **bold** _ital_ : event **bold** _ital_
  section "`section **bold** _ital_`"
    "`period **bold** _ital_`" : "`event **bold** _ital_`"
  section `section **bold** _ital_`
    `period **bold** _ital_` : `event **bold** _ital_`
  section section a `code` b
    period a `code` b : event a `code` b
  section section <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
    period <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O : event <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
  section section one\ntwo
    period one\ntwo : event one\ntwo
